<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_n0013/tu_0021> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "It is recommended to apply tight glucose control, targeting a near-normal HbA1c (<7.0% or <53 mmol/mol) to decrease microvascular complications in DM" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_n0013/tu_0008> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "In T2DM patients, it is recommended to exercise at least 3–5 days/week at least 30 min per session at a moderate-to-high intensity (at least 50–70% peak oxygen uptake)" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_n0013/e_0013/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingStatus> "UNMAPPED" .
